{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-05-03 09:10:00', 'title': 'FINAL DEADLINE REMINDER FOR MTCH INVESTORS: KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT FILED AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. (MTCH)', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA. , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP INFORMS INVESTORS THAT THE FIRM HAS FILED A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. ("MATCH") ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR ACQUIRED MATCH (NASDAQ: MTCH) COMMON STOCK BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021 THROUGH JANUARY 31, 2023 , INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-05-03 04:30:00', 'title': 'FINAL DEADLINE IMMINENT: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN MATCH GROUP, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / MAY 3, 2023 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. ("MATCH" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ:MTCH) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021 AND JANUARY 31, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE MAY 5, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-05-03 01:05:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF MATCH GROUP, INC. - MTCH', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0\xa0MATCH GROUP, INC.\xa0("MATCH" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0MTCH).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}